<title>CANADA: Poco completes US$75 mln placement.</title>
<headline>Poco completes US$75 mln placement.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY, Alberta 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poco Petroleums Ltd said on Friday it completed a US$75 million private placement of senior notes with The Prudential Insurance Co of America.</p>
<p>The notes bear interest at 7.0 percent, have an average life of 12 years and mature in December 2011. Poco said it used proceeds to refinance existing debt.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
